# Accepted findings, each with a reason and a review date. An entry with
# no justification is how a scanner quietly stops meaning anything.
#
# Nothing is ignored today. Base image CVEs are reported by the pipeline
# and not gated, which is a threshold decision rather than a suppression,
# so they do not belong in this file.
#
# Format when something is added:
#   CVE-YYYY-NNNNN   # why it is accepted, who decided, when to revisit
